# Agent workflow

Read root `AGENTS.md`, the v1 architecture, relevant source and tests, and the
current runbook before acting.

When finishing work, report changed paths, commands and results, tests,
blockers, and the next gated step.

- Do not edit product repositories while changing the Harness.
- Do not push, merge, deploy, enable services, or clean dirty work without
  explicit human approval.
- Do not load archived product specifications or research dumps by default.
